{"4333780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Whippet At Large", "steam_appid": 4333780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333780/extras/002978c547ca41361ca64579ad8349dc.avif?t=1773406283\" width=574 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a day in the life of an extremely needy whippet (~15 minutes of adorable gameplay)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your owner constantly leaves you to go to work, you have no choice but to break out and find her before you die of loneliness! Interact with the locals to help find her. And yes, this game is based off of my own dog Zorro. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333780/extras/96d6cb6747fcd658a9fcc39440ed29e6.webp?t=1773406283\" width=201 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful Pixel Art</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorable neighborhood + characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple click and point problem solving</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a bite-sized version of a larger project I’m developing :) I hope people have fun with this is the meantime! </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333780/extras/002978c547ca41361ca64579ad8349dc.avif?t=1773406283\" width=574 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a day in the life of an extremely needy whippet (~15 minutes of adorable gameplay)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your owner constantly leaves you to go to work, you have no choice but to break out and find her before you die of loneliness! Interact with the locals to help find her. And yes, this game is based off of my own dog Zorro. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333780/extras/96d6cb6747fcd658a9fcc39440ed29e6.webp?t=1773406283\" width=201 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful Pixel Art</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorable neighborhood + characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple click and point problem solving</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a bite-sized version of a larger project I’m developing :) I hope people have fun with this is the meantime! </p>", "short_description": "Your owner has abandoned you yet again for something she calls a “job.” You must find her quickly before the lack of attention becomes fatal.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333780/b3d2d6452291cc3ff1141b6665051ad3a34846cb/header.jpg?t=1773406283", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333780/e353a4de9606984ada7e581866588fd4bd9e4f39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773406283", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333780/e353a4de9606984ada7e581866588fd4bd9e4f39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773406283", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br>